  "details": "Emoji\n\n- \"Sparkles\" wrong collection (has \"Pride Month 2025\", when it released with the Starter Bundle)\n\nStickers\n\n- \"Smug Cat\", \"Rat Floaties\", \"Point\", \"Weather\", \"Staring Strawberry\", \"Summer Heat\" missing \"Summer 2025\" collection \n\nEmoji\n\n- \"Maths\", \"Brick\", \"Sparkles\", \"Bees\" missing \"Starter Bundle\" collection \n\nStickers\n\n- \"Chad Rat\", \"Portal\", \"Thinking Cat\", \"VRRat Cat Costume\", \"VRCat Rat Costume\" missing \"Starter Bundle\" collection \n\nItems\n\n- \"Bubble Blaster\" missing \"Summer 2025\" collection\n\n- \"Rainbow Ribbon\" missing \"Pride 2025\" collection\n\n- \"Campfire\", \"Marshmallow on a Stick\" missing \"August 2025\" or \"VRC+ Drop\"? collection\n\nSpookality 2025 content all missing \"Spookality 2025\" collection\n\n- \"Laughing Face\", \"Lightning Zap\", \"Funk-O-Lantern\" emoji\n\n- \"L1-V3 Portal\"\n\n- \"Kath Evil\", \"Kath Crazy\", \"Treats Scared\", \"Treats Nom\" stickers\n\n- \"Kath\", \"Treats\", \"Candy Codex\" items\n\n- \"Doot\", \"Abduction\", \"Spellz\", \"Witch Kitty\" stickers\n\nAll of these have the proper tag associated with them via the API, but not the collection. What is the difference between these? Why aren't these exposed like the world & avatar tags?\n\nUnsure how VRChat wants collections to work, as for example the \"Campfire\", and \"Marshmallow on a Stick\" items have \"August 2025\" tag applied but having a collection per month seems a bit too granular. Maybe those drops can just have a basic \"VRC+ Drop\" collection?",
